WEBVTT

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:06.080
- How are you Kaya?
 - I'm doing well Arashi.

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:11.530
- Good to hear.
- I saw an interesting action shot today.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:16.370
- What is the name of the picture?
- Well...

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:20.890
- ... I forget the title.
- Can you tell me what the story is?

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.060
I sure will.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.900
It is about a colorful masterpiece.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.730
The people had on colorful costumes.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:34.880
They danced through the white jungle elegantly and wildly.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.440
They went through the yellow wilderness and bright red sun.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:42.300
The lush green covered the earth.
 The five elements coming together...

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.450
...created an elegant and bold scene.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.380
From that, peace and love was brought to the earth.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:52.300
Wow, what a story that tickles my appetite!

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.720
Do you know of such a dish?

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:57.010
Yes, of course!

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:02.750
- Do you really know?
- Yes, of course!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.990
Using the powers of "Arashi"...

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:12.810
...they face numerous enemies in the fight for the ball.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.560
In the end, they make the crucial shot, and earn their victory.

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:21.450
Wow, what an exciting story.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.310
That team had a phrase they always said.

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:26.310
What is it?

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:29.880
"All five united, we are Goren!"

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:28.920
Everyone line up! Count yourselves off!
 -One, two, three, four, five, six.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:32.400
I have a question for all of you. 
 - When I say "summer" what do you think of? OK, Jun?!

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:35.680
- OK, um. 
- Hajime.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:39.650
- The beach, bathing suits, hot springs, yukatas, and ghost hunting!  
- Correct.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.830
- That's all the things we did. 
- You're correct too, Jun.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:50.690
But as team "Hakobune" we still haven't completed our task for the summer.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.170
What is it?

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.080
We're going to start serving cold noodles.

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:05.500
I love cold noodles!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.160
Jagged Heart Lullaby

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:16.250
Oh I didn't know you liked cold noodles, Arashi.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:19.200
I've eaten it once when I was young.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:24.550
I couldn't forget that taste. 
 It was so delicious!

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:28.530
Interesting that Arashi would speak so passionately about it.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:34.110
I feel that it's going to be popular! 
 We're going to recreate those noodles.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:40.230
But, I don't think amateurs will be able to recreate that taste.

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.450
It might even be hard for professionals.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.490
It had an amazing taste!

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:52.220
I've only eaten store-bought noodles. 
It sounds like it has a taste that I won't be able to understand.

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.810
Well I like the store-bought ones for what it is.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.650
Hmm... What was it called?

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:02.450
It had a flavor that was cold noodles, but at the same time it wasn't.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:05.040
Hmm. Now I'm really interested.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:09.640
We won't be able to make that.
 We should just stick to a normal one.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:14.510
Oh. We should name it after Arashi and call it...

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.530
... "Arashi Chuka."

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.930
Really?!
 Are you really going to name it that?

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:30.440
- Sure. Since it sounds like a "Hakobune" original.   
- Yay!

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.350
Not just regular cold noodles but "Arashi Chuka."

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.120
The second and third vowels are the same.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.340
Quite admirable for the Master.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:47.850
<i>She's frustrated because the Master said the joke first.</i>

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.560
Um, what kind of dish is cold noodles?

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:56.540
- What, you don't know?   
- I don't know what it is.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.340
For real?

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:09.420
Oh right, it's something that you've never had.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:12.820
Right, Arashi comes from a good family.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:16.540
She has eaten things that we've never ate before.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.240
- You've never seen it either?   
- No.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.960
Hmm. That sounds like it.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:27.020
There are many opinions on the origin but...

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:32.270
...it's a legendary dish that disappeared with the food crisis.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:37.210
That's just non-sensetalking. We should just make it!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:42.340
Arashi, can you explain what that tastes like?

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:47.170
- Well, it was... 
- It was...

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.140
... I forget the recipe.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:56.390
Anyway, I didn't make it. Why would I know the recipe?

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:01.540
- Arashi-san... I can't believe you. 
- Well, what can we do?

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.500
Kanako-san, you're not going to get mad?

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.810
She's used to forgetting things from Yayoi.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:11.870
You promised me that you wouldn't say that, Kanako!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:16.320
- Did I promise you that?   
- I can't believe you!

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.170
Seems to be fun.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:26.700
Can you tell me what kind of dish it is?

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:31.700
I sure will. 
 There was a cold feeling in the air.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:35.940
The deep green and yellow colors were intertwined gracefully.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:40.950
It was like an art piece.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:47.250
- What an artistic dish!   
- Do you know of such a dish?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.150
Of course, I know it.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.360
- Let's make this, Yayoi  
- Sure.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:08:00.970
- Oh, they're gone.  
- Well, we should let them do their thing.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.630
The taste will be judged by Arashi.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:08.500
Leave it up to me! I will revive that legendary taste!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.820
Alright, we should start too.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.740
Kaya, do you know how to make cold noodles?!

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:21.490
Oh good! You should have told us. We can leave Kaya to the task!

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:25.630
- Call me when you're done! 
- Wait!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.670
We're here for you, Kaya-san!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:33.970
- I'll start making it and you taste test it, Arashi-san!   
- Got it!

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.410
Sa---salt.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:46.030
Hey! Don't make something that'll worry the customers.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:48.430
Hey, I can't help it! It's the truth!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:52.700
I'm done!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.110
These are...?

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:57.190
Cold noodles.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.750
I'm going to eat it.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.040
This isn't the taste.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:17.600
Why did you act like it was almost it?! 
 These obviously aren't cold noodles!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.750
Jun, you're so sad.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:26.410
Everything isn't black and white.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:29.850
What Kaya-san made were noodles with shaved ice.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:34.360
But, does that hamper our quest? No!

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:38.850
What we are after is the legendary, "Arashi Chuka!"

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:45.170
Kaya-san, if you don't know how to make it 
 just tell us you don't know how.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.250
Oh no, I do.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:52.700
She's utilizing her anger that she wasn't able to say the joke in a wrong way.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:58.000
It has a taste, a real bold one. 
 I wonder what it's missing.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:00.990
- I'm going to make it again.
- I'll help!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:07.970
How long is it going to take?
 Cold noodles, noodles, noodles!

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:10.460
I want to eat some right now.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.390
Hello? 
 Where are you right now?

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.170
Sa---salt.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.410
- Start boiling the noodles!
- OK!

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:24.750
- Kaya, the vegetables! 
- Got it!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.170
Hajime, now!

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:32.480
- Kaya, top the vegetables! 
 - Alright!

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.330
Wow.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:39.190
- It's done! 
- Yay!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:47.000
Now for the taste!

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.330
This is so good!

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:57.750
But, this isn't the taste I was looking for.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:01.000
I can't react to their stupidity sometimes.

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.130
Thank you very much!

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:13.120
Man, I really don't feel like it.

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.250
Sa---Salt.

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:22.660
Hey, how's it coming along? 
 Were you able to get the taste?

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:27.690
Oh, where's Arashi and the others?

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.360
Rain?

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:35.730
- Alright, I'm gonna start it!   
- I'm ready!

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:50.380
This is just like "nagashi soumen."

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.360
I'm going to make cold noodles for them!

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:03.330
- Can you really make it? 
 - I've never made it before, but I know I'm better than them!

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:06.060
- Right.
- Thank you for waiting.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:13.160
There's a cold feeling in the air. The deep green and yellow colors are intertwined gracefully.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:17.060
And it is like a small art piece.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:20.040
This is...!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.740
Cold noodles!

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:47.010
Man, this legendary taste is something really hard to come by.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.590
I think we're pretty close though.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:55.790
It feels like we're one salt shake away.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:04.600
I'm hungry.

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:11.230
Oh. I believe there was a cookbook in the back room.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:18.310
I'm coming across an idea. 
 Arashi-san, I need some time to think!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.330
Alright, me too!

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:26.220
- I'm going to go search for the book.
- I can't believe them.

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:30.340
- I'm really hungry. 
- I'm finished.

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:36.840
Oh, I have to record it.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.100
May I have some salt?

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.570
Oh, I don't want to go home!

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:01.500
- Where is Yasaka?  
- He's waiting for his idea to come to him.

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:06.410
- Oh, Jun-kun, what is this?  
- I tried to make the cold noodles.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:10.340
- Wow, Jun-kun, you're a genius!  
- Oh, stop it.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:14.190
I can't assure the taste though. I didn't know the spices...

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:18.270
...and the topping may slightly be off.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:27.730
Wow, this is delicious! This is the taste I was looking for, Jun-kun!

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:31.450
- Really?!
- This is the legendary taste!

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.610
I want Hajime-chan to try this too!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.980
- Hajime-chan! Hajime-chan!  
- Wait a minute!

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:44.990
- We were so close.   
- We have to fail to succeed.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:48.330
- The basics of cooking are?!  
- "Sa, Shi, Su, Se, So!"

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:52.670
We're suppose to add the ingredients in the order of the alphabet!

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:55.890
Well done, Yayoi!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.650
- Sa?! 
- Salsa, sauce!

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:58.960
- Shi?! 
- Shottsuru!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.420
- Su?! 
- Suppon extract!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:01.660
- Se?! 
- Back oil!

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.120
- So?! 
- Sausage!

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:06.860
Wonderful! That was perfect, Yayoi!

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:16.760
This is what we were looking for. Let's have Arashi try it later.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.580
Wonderful, we followed the basics of cooking.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:35.880
"Sa, shi, su, se, so?" 
 Cuttlefish, preserved squid, dried squid, rice crackers, and sausage.

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:39.390
Wonderful, the basics of cooking are the snacks for drinking.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:48.210
Now it's perfect! "Sa, shi, su, se, so!"

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:53.060
That's strange, I couldn't find it in the back shed either.

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:55.870
Where did that cookbook go?

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:10.220
The basics of cooking are "Sa, shi, su, se, so." 
 I'm supposed to put sugar in first.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.040
Sweet things never taste bad.

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:29.530
- Hurry, hurry!  
- Are you serious?

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.700
Wow, it looks great!

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.810
Go right ahead. Dig in!

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.940
Hajime-chan! Don't leave me!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.840
Arashi-san. Did you find Yasaka?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:55.310
- What happened, Yasaka!
- When he took a bite he just...

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:04.250
- Awful taste. 
- You ate the whole thing?!

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.500
Someone changed my recipe!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:14.590
It was such a great taste before! I can't believe them!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:19.700
Just wait Jun-kun! 
- I'll make sure your efforts don't go to waste!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.920
I'll get back the "Arashi Chuka" for you!

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.880
Hajime-chan please!

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.970
"Sa, shi, su, se, so"

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:41.290
Alright, this is the legendary taste!

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.730
Hold up!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:53.700
Disgusting! We have to go further into the past!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:57.590
- Arashi-san! 
- ... the basics of cooking.

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:05.790
- Maybe this time!  
- I'm going to eat it!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.150
No! Hajime-chan!

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:20.720
- I'm afraid of cold noodles... cold noodles... cold noodles.
- Hajime-chan!

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.700
- Oh, you're OK!
- Arashi-san.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.900
I remember when I made those noodles.

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.040
- Really?
- Yes.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:35.240
It was right before my sister's show started, so it was right around two.

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:37.920
If we go right at that time...

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:43.560
I have to record it!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.620
- This is it.
- This is what we're looking for.

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:50.910
The legendary cold noodles!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.510
- Someone's here!
- Here, Hajime-chan.

00:18:57.480 --> 00:19:01.550
Hey Master. I bought you the stuff. You should thank me.

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.070
Thanks. Just leave it there.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:09.770
I can't believe her. I had to come during work hours.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:12.800
Hmm.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.730
Quite bland tasting.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:22.450
What are they making here?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:26.270
There we go now it looks better.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:32.770
Alright, I just need Arashi-san to try it.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:39.710
Here you go. This is what the "Arashi Chuka" is supposed to taste like.

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:44.270
-This is?! 
- Yea! Dig in!

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:46.940
- Alright, I'll try it.
- OK.

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:49.530
We're going to eat.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:54.560
How is it? It's really tasty huh?!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.460
Jun, did you make this?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.880
- I think so.
- This is the legendary taste?

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:06.280
- Um.
- Ms. Arashiyama...

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:10.040
- I'll tell you straightforward. It taste awful.
- What? Really?

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:20.550
What the heck is this?!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:27.460
Where did that taste... the legendary taste go?!

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:33.390
It's something amateurs should have never tried.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:36.290
It's really hard to replicate a legendary taste, huh?

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:40.360
It's not because Arashi can't tell what good food tastes like?

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:45.300
We actually don't know if the legendary taste is even good.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:50.180
- Oh well. Let's think of a new dish.
- You're right.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:54.060
Hey... where did my cold noodles go?

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:31.660
- How are you, Yayoi?
- I'm doing well, Kanako.

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:34.180
That's good to hear.

00:22:34.530 --> 00:22:37.650
I saw another interesting moving picture.

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:42.240
-Well, what's the name of this moving picture?
- It is...

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:47.650
- ...something I forget the title of. 
- Can you tell me what kind of story it is?

00:22:47.650 --> 00:22:49.630
Sure thing.

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:54.410
It is an endless story about a man.

00:22:54.570 --> 00:22:59.790
He was respected as a king, though  he had a hole in his heart.

00:22:59.790 --> 00:23:04.980
He was never able to fill that void. But fate had it...

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:08.330
...he met a boy that would lead him to a world of joy.

00:23:08.420 --> 00:23:11.000
Where he was moved by this.

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:15.140
Where he couldn't control his emotions pouring out.

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:17.880
Wow, what a passionate story!

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:21.000
There was a phrase that emperor said.

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:22.880
What was it?

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:29.290
"It's TA-ST-Y!"

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.080
- When I mention cold noodles?!
- I like the sesame dressing.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:38.880
- I smoke cigarettes, so the vinegar hurts me.
- No! That's the great part!

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:42.280
- I always start coughing. 
- Wake up early next week!
